# Build context hygiene for the Next.js standalone image.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` (Dockerfile:10) uploads node_modules/, .next/ and the
# test artifacts on every build, and busts the cached `deps` layer (Dockerfile:4-5)
# on each source edit. It also drops real secrets into the builder stage: .env.local
# is gitignored (so git will not save you) but Docker does not read .gitignore.

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image.
node_modules
.next
out
build

# Secrets: .env.local holds live credentials in local dev. Never bake it into a
# layer, the build cache, or a pushed image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Test + tooling artifacts
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report
.playwright
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# VCS and editor noise
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Docker's own ignore file (avoids a redundant context scan)
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
